{
  "audio": "009.let-us-open.mp3",
  "paragraph": 9,
  "text": "Let us open the hood on Pillar One: the core agent loop. Strip away the branding, and the heart of almost every production agent is a tiny, fifteen-line loop following four simple beats: think, act, observe, and repeat. On each pass, the harness sends the current message history to the model so it can think. If the model decides to act, the harness executes the requested tool, appends the real output so the model can observe what happened, and repeats until the task is complete.",
